        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "47 Kilfenora Road, Kimmage, Dublin 12\r\n\r\nDavid Ross Estate Agents, your local property experts are delighted to present new to market no.47 Kilfenora Road. This fine 2 bed end of terrace property comes to the market sure to catch the eye of any discerning purchaser.\r\n\r\nNestled in the heart of Kimmage, number 47 is surrounded by a host of local amenities. With many shops, cafes and restaurants, parks and sports facilities nearby you’ll never be short of things to do. Areas such as Harolds Cross and Terenure are also within very close proximity.\r\n\r\nLet's start with the ground floor which, with its open plan layout, is filled with light and space. The flow and character of this space is a perfect example of modern family living. With a living area to the front, which brings you nicely into the modern dining/kitchen area, this space has everything you would need and more.\r\n\r\nTo the rear of the house you have a fully finished back garden, a quiet, private and tranquil space to spend time relaxing or entertaining family and friends.\r\n\r\nUpstairs briefly comprises two bedrooms, a double to the rear and a larger master bedroom to the front aspect. A modern and fully tiled family bathroom completes the first floor of this magnificent property.\r\n\r\nKilfenora Road benefits from fantastic public transport links with several bus routes running through the area. The M50 motorway is nearby as well which opens up access to the Greater Dublin Area and surrounding counties.\r\n\r\nThis property will be very popular so early viewing would be recommended to see everything this property has to offer.\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nFeatures;\r\n- Off street parking\r\n- Open plan\r\n- End terrace\r\n- Turn key condition\r\n- Private back garden"
      },
      {
